---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
	title="About Image Optimizer - Secure & Private Image Compression"
	description="Learn how Image Optimizer provides secure, local image compression and conversion. Everything happens in your browser, ensuring your privacy."
>
	<section class="py-24">
		<div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
			<h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink mb-8">About Image Optimizer</h1>
			<div class="prose prose-sm text-body">
				<p class="mb-4">
					Image Optimizer is a privacy-focused tool built for developers and designers who need fast, local image processing.
				</p>
				<p class="mb-4">
					Unlike other tools that upload your images to a server, everything here happens entirely in your browser using the Web Canvas API. This means your data never leaves your device, making it 100% secure and private.
				</p>
				<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink mt-8 mb-4">Key Features</h2>
				<ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
					<li>Local processing via Web Workers</li>
					<li>No server-side data storage</li>
					<li>Support for HEIC, PDF, and modern image formats</li>
					<li>Real-time visual and size feedback</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>
